@merrymercy this PR is now ready for review. Could you please run `/tag-and-rerun-ci extra` for the current head (`c4d3b3666cc0`) to enable Base + Extra CI?

This branch now includes upstream main `5ef99013ac3e`. The refresh also fixes forwarding of the new `host_token_capacity` argument into the NVFP4 host pool. Four new CPU regression cases cover default/explicit capacity with and without native scales, checking actual payload and scale allocation sizes. Local CPU validation passed: 30 tests for this PR, and 443 tests + 207 subtests combined with #43356. The repository-pinned pre-commit checks also passed.

The earlier GPU/model and benchmark results in the PR descriptions apply to the documented a99c7d050fae-based validation snapshot; they have not been rerun on these new heads. If GitHub requires approval for fork workflows, could you approve those as well?

